ivery guy swerved and hit a junction box on a power pole. It caused the lights to go off at a dramatic moment in game; someone in the group then had to help pull the pizza guy out of a vehicle that was rapidly catching fire before calling emergency services..</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, though it could be completely unrelated, RichD's mother died of cancer this January.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2456-zeroninja","name":"zeroninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T07:40:22-07:00","id":985411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/983030-any-news-on-when-the-next-20th-kickstarter-will-be?p=985090#post985090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Except <b>Ends of Empire</b>. That thing just seemed to spring up out of nowhere.</div> </div> </div> </div>...to promptly end the line. All things about the curse make things linger, other than to pack things up and appease, for a time, whatever malevolent force powers it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T07:43:20-07:00","id":985414,"title":"","content":"My own advice for Wraith is to allow a more epic style. Wraiths from all ages of History. lots of them with experencie in the battlefield or crysis. Epic action and splatterpunk together is possible, like the videogames &quot;Doom&quot;, &quot;Clive Baker's Jericho&quot; or &quot;Mortal Kombat&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T08:27:17-07:00","id":985434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/983030-any-news-on-when-the-next-20th-kickstarter-will-be?p=984874#post984874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Demon 20 should add Devil's Due, Earthbound, Savior and Destroyers (demon-hunters)m Dammen and deceived (thralls). I would add a page to suggest how to play a no-Jew-Christian demon in a fantasy world like Warhammer or Exalted, or like playing djinns PCs with demon game-mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>To copy from a Demon20 thread where I made a post:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Looking at the other 20th Anniversary books, I've noted that Vampire20 and Werewolf20 have very similar layouts. The first six chapters are more or less the same: A World of Darkness/Character types/Character Creation/Special powers/Rules/Dramatic Systems. They then get their own things (Morality/Spirit World), followed by the Storytelling chapter. They then both have the Enemies chapter and the misc stuff, but Werewolf has an Allies chapter as well. Meanwhile, Mage20 has four chapters of background before going with similar chapters: Charcter types/Character Creaton/Storytelling/Rules/Dramatic Systems/Powers, ending again with an enemies appendix followed by a misc stuff appendix.<br /> <br /> Looking at this I feel that a layout similar to the Vampire and Werewolf layout.<br /> <br /> Book 1: Elohim<br /> - Chapter 1: A World of Darkness (the background of the game, from <i>Fiat Lux</i> to the escape from the Abyss)<br /> - Chapter 2: Houses of Darkness (the seven Houses of the Elohim and the five Factions, each explained in a nice double page as well as their take on each other and the Factions. The Factions are all described as well as how they interact with one another)<br /> Book 2: Fallen<br /> - Chapter 3: Characters (full explaination on how to build your characters with the Attributes, Abilities, Backgrounds and Virtues)<br /> - Chapter 4: Lores &amp; Forms (rules on how to use the various Lores as well how Apocalypse Forms work, the basic ones for each of the Lores)<br /> - Chapter 5: Rules (how to play the game)<br /> - Chapter 6: Dramatic Systems (you know what this does)<br /> - Chapter 7: Relics and Rituals (rules for Relics and how to make them as well as Rituals and how to perform them)<br /> Book 3: Earthbound<br /> - Chapter 8: Storytelling (how to run the game as a Storyteller)<br /> - Chapter 9: Pacts and Thralls (how Pacts work, how to find Thralls, rules on how Faith can be gained and how a Storyteller can make Thralls)<br /> - Chapter 10: Antagonists (rules for the Earthbound and how to make them, as well as rules for demon hunters)<br /> Appendix 1: Merits &amp; Flaws (speaks for itself)<br /> Appendix 2: Nature of the Beast (DIY Apocalypse Form rules)<br /> <br /> This should fit pretty much all the rules into a single big tome, 666 pages in length. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T10:25:17-07:00","id":985494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beriorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/983030-any-news-on-when-the-next-20th-kickstarter-will-be?p=985434#post985434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To copy from a Demon20 thread where I made a post:<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Hell to the YES!~!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"u